  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. Boil the kettle.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook plant-based mince, breaking up with a spoon, until just browned, 4-5 minutes.\n• Meanwhile, grate carrot, then set aside. Thinly slice apple into wedges.\n• In a medium bowl, combine apple and mixed salad leaves. Set aside. Little cooks: Help wash and tear the salad leaves!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6316dccbb140a69dcc0916ed/step-3021a633.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To the pan with the mince, add carrot, garlic paste, tomato paste, Nan's special seasoning and arborio rice. Cook, stirring, until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add the boiling water (2 cups for 2 people / 4 cups for 4 people) and vegetable stock pot (see ingredients), then bring to the boil.\n• Transfer risotto to a baking dish. Cover tightly with foil. Bake until liquid is absorbed and rice is 'al dente', 24-28 minutes. TIP: For best results, drain the oil from the beef mince from the pan before adding the carrot. TIP: 'Al dente' rice is cooked through but still slightly firm in the centre.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6316dccbb140a69dcc0916ed/step-a57bfa91.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When risotto is ready, stir through the butter and 1/2 the grated Parmesan cheese. Season with pepper.\n• To the bowl with the salad, add balsamic vinaigrette dressing. Toss to coat. TIP: Stir through a splash of water if the risotto looks dry!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6316dccbb140a69dcc0916ed/step-8015bdc7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide plant-based beef bolognese risotto between bowls. Sprinkle with remaining Parmesan.\n• Serve with apple salad. Enjoy! Little cooks: Add the finishing touch by sprinkling over the Parmesan!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6316dccbb140a69dcc0916ed/step-2eef9993.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
